# The working tree is LF everywhere, on every platform.
#
# Prettier has no `endOfLine` override here, so it defaults to `lf`. Without this file a checkout
# on Windows (`core.autocrlf=true`) materialises CRLF, and `format:check` then fails on files
# nobody touched - a gate reporting the operating system rather than the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
